{"id":199,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Slowking can solve any problem presented to it, but no one can understand a thing Slowking says."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Miraculously, this former Slowpoke’s latent intelligence was drawn out when Shellder poison raced through its brain."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It’s called “the sage of the sea.” It engages in battles of wits with Oranguru, but the result is usually a draw."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It’s constantly coming up with new ideas that would change the world, but as soon as it hits upon a new idea, it forgets it."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"This Pokémon is so famed for its intellect that a proverb still persists in some regions: “When in doubt, ask Slowking.”"},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"A poisonous bite reacted with its system, blessing it with the enhanced intellect of a genius. It has full control of its psychic powers."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Slowking undertakes research every day in an effort to solve the mysteries of the world. However, this Pokémon apparently forgets everything it has learned if the Shellder on its head comes off."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"When its head was bitten, toxins entered Slowpoke’s head and unlocked an extraordinary power."},{"games":["X","HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"It has incredible intellect and intuition. Whatever the situation, it remains calm and collected."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Being bitten by Shellder gave it intelligence comparable to that of award-winning scientists."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It undertakes research every day to solve the mysteries of the world. However, it apparently forgets everything if the SHELLDER on its head comes off."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"Every time it yawns, SHELLDER injects more poison into it. The poison makes it more intelligent."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Oblivious","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is oblivious, keeping it from being infatuated, falling for taunts, or being affected by Intimidate."},{"name":"Own Tempo","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon sticks to its own tempo, preventing it from becoming confused or being affected by Intimidate."},{"name":"Regenerator","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon has a little of its HP restored when withdrawn from battle."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Water 1"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"water's edge","color":"Pink","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":79,"name":"Slowpoke","condition":null,"children":[{"id":80,"name":"Slowbro","condition":"Lv. 37 or Use Galarica Cuff","children":[]},{"id":199,"name":"Slowking","condition":"Trade, holding King’s Rock or Use Galarica Wreath","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,45],[1,55],[1,174],[1,207],[1,408],[1,417],[9,281],[12,93],[15,50],[18,352],[21,29],[27,133],[30,57],[33,303],[36,94],[39,244],[42,240],[45,505]],"machine":[133,419,59,34,280,523,347,886,174,91,409,89,203,797,263,126,7,53,374,411,264,492,248,416,447,56,63,58,8,196,286,334,113,710,118,341,330,417,408,182,60,244,94,917,678,473,240,115,156,157,317,503,247,285,214,883,500,164,241,57,129,36,851,9,86,271,433,352,127,311,250,428],"egg":[881,248],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv8pt5-19","name":"Slowking","set":"Prismatic Evolutions","date":"2025-01-17","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"19","artist":null,"img":"sv8pt5/19"},{"id":"sv7-58","name":"Slowking","set":"Stellar Crown","date":"2024-09-13","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"58","artist":null,"img":"sv7/58"},{"id":"sv2-86","name":"Slowking ex","set":"Paldea Evolved","date":"2023-06-09","rarity":"Double Rare","number":"86","artist":"5ban Graphics","img":"sv2/86"},{"id":"sv2-238","name":"Slowking ex","set":"Paldea Evolved","date":"2023-06-09","rarity":"Ultra Rare","number":"238","artist":"5ban Graphics","img":"sv2/238"},{"id":"swsh6-